    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNE: [Where should grandma’s picture go?]\nMONICA: [We’re not staying. Leave it in there.]\nANNE: Is the murmur getting louder?\nMONICA: [Mmm. We will need to keep checking. ...We need to find a home near a hospital too.]",
      "ANNE: [Mom. Why will the house fly away?]\nMONICA: [It isn’t attached to the land.]\nANNE: [But why?]\nMONICA: [Didn’t you see? The house is on wheels.]",
      "MONICA: [Of course we aren’t on any map.]\nANNE: God please save our family. God please save our family...",
      "ANNE: [Why don’t you ever hang this up?]\nMONICA: [This?]\nANNE: [In other houses they put up wedding pictures...]\nMONICA: [Is that so? Maybe later...]",
      "MONICA: [We need to get you both new shoes. There’s a clothing store in that little town.]\nMONICA: [We’ll look our best for grandma.]\nANNE: [Mom, from now on, do we have to burn all our trash?]\nMONICA: [Yes. Isn’t the city better? Careful of the smoke.]"
    ]
  },
